# Normal-mode vectors of the tests/apps fixture calc-water-vib (G16 water),
# mode 2 (O-H stretch), in the two styles where the arrows used to vanish
# inside the atom spheres.  The arrows are rebuilt after each style change.
style Ball And Stick
viewall
nmvect 2
snap calc-water-vectors-base
style CPK
nmvect 2
snap calc-water-vectors-cpk
